Bundled Rust crates
------------------
The committed vendor directory contains the crates pinned by Cargo.lock,
including Arma, Burrow, Devtree and PMI from their pinned Git revisions.
These retain their upstream copyrights and licenses. LICENSE.dependencies
records each crate's name, version, declared license and authors, together
with the license and notice files supplied by that crate. It is generated
from the vendor directory and installed alongside this file.

The vendor tree includes runtime, build, test and other-platform
dependencies; their license declarations and supplied notices are
recorded there too.
